			"notes": "This release is the first for Minecraft version **1.20.1**. Other 1.20.x versions have not been tested. Apart from version compatibility, this release has the following changes:\n- New `color.json` entry `sculk`, with properties `start` and `end` that control the starting and ending color of sculk sensor particles, respectively.\n```json\n\"sculk\": {\n  \"start\": \"ffffff\",\n  \"end\": \"111111\"\n}\n```"
		},
