			"notes": "It's out! Yes, it's one month late for the 1.18.2 release, but in my defense, I do this on an almost pure interest-only basis :P. This release contains a few quality of life improvements, including\n - Warning when `blocks`, `biomes`, or `grid` properties are provided for colormaps outside of `colormaps/custom`, as these properties are ignored for them.\n - `grid` properties now allow string items, which expand to `{ \"biomes\": [<the value>], \"width\": 1, \"column\": <auto-incremented> }`."
